BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (The common starting point is a broken handoff, not an AI agent looking for something to do. Erin at Paired Recruiting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (describes remote teams losing time because a form arrives, a lead sits unseen, or the next person never learns that work) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (is ready. Their basic automation moves a submission into a CRM, notifies the team, and creates a task without someone) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (coordinating every transfer. LearnAI Today describes the same operating pattern through inquiries, welcome emails,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (and invoice entry: identify the trigger, apply the rules, and perform the action. Jonas reduces the architecture to two) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (parts, triggers and actions, including triggers that come from another automation. That agreement matters for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (productized offer: the deliverable is an operating process, not merely a connection between two logos. Paired's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (examples extend into onboarding, documents, content status updates, and internal coordination. Jonas sells chatbots,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (lead follow-ups, and payment syncs built from that same pattern. The tools differ in how builders express the sequence,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (but the underlying job remains moving information and starting the next useful action without repeated manual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (checking. Paired's instruction is to start with one process, get it working, and build from there. Paired Recruiting) Tj ET
