BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (therefore stays central to each recommendation. Marc favors Zapier for owners and marketing or operations teams) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (minimizing build time, Make for advanced no-code builders, and n8n for technical teams wanting infrastructure) Tj ET
