BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 194.83 Tm (search handled basic keywords but did not deliver the advanced matching the team needed. Vector retrieval then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 179.60 Tm (introduced two problems: chunking could blur facts, and dense enterprise collections used so much overlapping) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 164.38 Tm (language that nearest-neighbor results became difficult to distinguish. Their Apple timeline example confuses the) Tj ET
